---------------------------- MODULE D3D8Groups ----------------------------
(* Direct3D 8's state block types as Windows answers them (D3D8.SB.GROUPS): a block made by
   CreateStateBlock of a type (1 ALL, 2 PIXELSTATE, 3 VERTEXSTATE) holds the type's states at the
